  Experiment 6b       12,000
  Experiment 6c       12,000
  Experiment 6d       12,000
  Experiment 7a        1,000
  Experiment 7b        1,000
  Experiment A1        9,000
  Experiment A2        6,000
  Experiment 1R        5,978
  Experiment 1T        5,925

