.                 lab var combined_loan_to_value_ratio "LTV (Actual, \%)"

. 
.                 eststo clear

.                 estpost tabstat actually_approved interest_rate rate_spread d
> ebt_to_income_ratio combined_loan_to_value_ratio, c(s) s(n mean sd p50)

