.         di _n "Sec. 6.1: Figure 5 slope = " %5.3f _b[rate_spread] "; t = " %5
> .2f `t_ols' " (OLS SE, as reported by binscatter), " ///
>                 %5.2f _b[rate_spread]/_se[rate_spread] " (robust SE)"

